# Telecom Customer Churn Risk Analyzer

An interactive machine learning web application built for an MSc in Artificial Intelligence project. It utilizes an optimized **XGBoost gradient boosting classifier** trained on the authentic IBM Telco Customer Churn dataset, paired with **SHAP (SHapley Additive exPlanations)** to provide dynamic, explainable risk factors for customer retention.

## Tech Stack
* **Core ML & Pipeline:** Python, Scikit-Learn, XGBoost, Joblib
* **Interpretability:** SHAP
* **Frontend UI:** Streamlit